+## Immediate command validation
+
+`gps_state/logging/validation/json` is not retained. A successful bridge validation resembles:
+
+```json
+{
+  "schema": "openmower.gps_state.logging.validation.v1",
+  "type": "control",
+  "valid": true,
+  "status": "forwarded",
+  "request_id": "ui-42",
+  "accepted": [{"command":"start"}],
+  "rejected": [],
+  "published_at": 1783951200.0
+}
+```
+
+`forwarded` confirms only that the bridge accepted and forwarded the command. It does not confirm `armed` or `running`. The app must wait for `gps_state/logging/status/json`.

 ## Runtime state machine

-| Runtime condition | `runtime.state` | `runtime.armed` | `runtime.running` | Recommended app action |
-|---|---|---:|---:|---|
-| No request | `idle` or `finished` | false | false | Enable Start |
-| Waiting for cycle/area | `armed` | true | false | Show Cancel |
-| Recording | `running` | false | true | Show Stop |
-| Completed | `finished` | false | false | Show result and Start |
-| Error | `error` | false | false | Show error and retry options |
